{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>He swears by His holiness</b> — in heaven, as in: \"For I lift up my hand to heaven\" (Deuteronomy 32:40)." "<b>בצנות [with fish-hooks]</b> — like \"and for hooks (ולצנינים)\" (Habakkuk 1:15); צנים are hooks." "<b>ואחריתכן [and your remnant]</b> — understand that אחרית stands in the sense of \"afterward,\" like \"nor to his latter end (ולא לאחריתו)\" (Numbers 24:20), which is his offspring." "<b>בסירות [in pots]</b> — like \"boiling pots (סירים סבוכים)\" (Micah 3:3)." "<b>דוגה [fish]</b> — like דג [fish]." "<b>ונשא [and he will carry]</b> — that the enemy, who is the foe mentioned, will command whoever carries you."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:00.801487794Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}